---
import { Check, ArrowRight, ShieldCheck } from "lucide-react";
---
<section class="setup-utilities container" aria-labelledby="setup-utilities-title">
  <div class="setup-explanation">
    <h2 id="setup-utilities-title">We’ve packaged the agent setup for you, too.</h2>
    <p>Configuring permissions, protecting credentials, and verifying isolation takes work before you even start.</p>
    <p><strong>Magpie supplies the tools and walks your agent through installation and verification.</strong> It is part of the default setup flow.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/docs/setup/secure-agent-setup" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">See what the setup includes <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
  </div>
  <div class="setup-example">
    <div class="setup-request">“Set up an isolated workspace for my agent.”</div>
    <div class="setup-prepared">
      <img src="/wordmark.svg" alt="Magpie" width="142" height="40" />
      <ul>
        <li><Check size={20} aria-hidden="true" /><span>Configures isolation for your agent.</span></li>
        <li><Check size={20} aria-hidden="true" /><span>Limits access to credentials and checks commands where your agent supports it.</span></li>
        <li><Check size={20} aria-hidden="true" /><span>Checks the setup and reports anything missing.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="setup-approval"><ShieldCheck size={22} aria-hidden="true" /><span>You approve the proposed changes before installation.</span></p>
  </div>

</section>
